11:["$","p","A space has exactly two members, and each person can be in one active space at a time. Joining needs both people to agree. Either of you can leave at any time. We will show you what happens to shared content before you confirm.",{"children":"A space has exactly two members, and each person can be in one active space at a time. Joining needs both people to agree. Either of you can leave at any time. We will show you what happens to shared content before you confirm."}]
12:["$","section","content",{"id":"content","className":"scroll-mt-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"t-title2","children":"What you share"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-3 flex flex-col gap-4 text-text-primary","children":[[["$","p","What you write and upload stays yours. You give us permission to store it, process it and show it to your partner as needed to run Klin, and nothing more. Only share things you have the right to share.",{"children":"What you write and upload stays yours. You give us permission to store it, process it and show it to your partner as needed to run Klin, and nothing more. Only share things you have the right to share."}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]
13:["$","section","rules",{"id":"rules","className":"scroll-mt-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"t-title2","children":"What is not allowed"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-3 flex flex-col gap-4 text-text-primary","children":[[["$","p","Please do not use Klin to harass, threaten, stalk or monitor another person, to share illegal content or content involving anyone under 18, to impersonate someone, or to attack or misuse the service. You can report content in the app. We may suspend accounts that break these rules.",{"children":"Please do not use Klin to harass, threaten, stalk or monitor another person, to share illegal content or content involving anyone under 18, to impersonate someone, or to attack or misuse the service. You can report content in the app. We may suspend accounts that break these rules."}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]
14:["$","section","assistant",{"id":"assistant","className":"scroll-mt-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"t-title2","children":"The assistant"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-3 flex flex-col gap-4 text-text-primary","children":[[["$","p","The assistant offers suggestions and is not a substitute for professional advice. It is not a therapist and does not diagnose. It can be wrong. If you are in danger or need urgent help, contact local emergency services.",{"children":"The assistant offers suggestions and is not a substitute for professional advice. It is not a therapist and does not diagnose. It can be wrong. If you are in danger or need urgent help, contact local emergency services."}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]
15:["$","section","plus",{"id":"plus","className":"scroll-mt-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"t-title2","children":"Klin Plus"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-3 flex flex-col gap-4 text-text-primary","children":[[["$","p","Klin Plus is an optional subscription bought through the App Store or Google Play. Price, billing period and any free trial are shown before you confirm, and nothing is charged without your confirmation. It renews automatically until you cancel in your store account. If either partner subscribes, Plus covers both members of the space for as long as the subscription is active. [Refund and trial terms to be completed.]",{"children":"Klin Plus is an optional subscription bought through the App Store or Google Play. Price, billing period and any free trial are shown before you confirm, and nothing is charged without your confirmation. It renews automatically until you cancel in your store account. If either partner subscribes, Plus covers both members of the space for as long as the subscription is active. [Refund and trial terms to be completed.]"}],["$","p","If a subscription ends, nothing you saved is deleted. Features that need Plus stop being available for new content.",{"children":"If a subscription ends, nothing you saved is deleted. Features that need Plus stop being available for new content."}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]
